          %p This page collects some links and other material related to the article
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergei+Gukov"}> Sergei Gukov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anton+Kapustin"} Anton Kapustin
              %p
                %em Topological Quantum Field Theory, Nonlocal Operators, and Gapped Phases of Gauge Theories
              %p
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1307.4793"}> arXiv:1307.4793
                )
          %p
            The article considers the generalization of a phenomenon in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spontaneous+symmetry+breaking"} spontaneous symmetry breaking
            in abelian (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+gauge+theory"}> higher
            )
            = succeed "," do
