            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+%28physics%29"} field
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monopoles"} monopoles
          %p
            The abelian phenomenon is reviewed and expanded on in its relation to higher dimensional
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/QFT+with+defects"} defect
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+operators"} quantum operators
            in section III. Generalization to the nonabelian case is then in section IV. An outlook on the relation to structures such as in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+Langlands+duality"} geometric Langlands duality
            is in section V.
